Rule 2 (input tensor must be at least 2-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 3 (the last two dimensions of input must be non-empty when rank ≥ 2)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then ∀i ∈ [ndim(v_1) - 2, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1 else false
>>
Rule 4 (operation name should not be the literal "none")
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 ≠ "none"
>>
Rule 7 (innermost matrix dimensions must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2 + i) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (batch dimensions positive when rank > 2)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 2 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 9 (name, if provided, is chosen from allowed strings)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "sum" ∨ v_2 = "max" ∨ v_2 = "min"
>>
Rule 10 (input tensor dtype must be numeric or complex, not bool)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 1 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 2 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 4 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
>>
Rule 11 (input must be at least 2-D, expressed via conditional)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then true else false
>>
Rule 12 (inner-most two dimensions exist and are valid sizes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) ≥ 0 else false
>>
Rule 13 (batch dimensions, when present, are valid sizes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 2 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 3] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 14 (sanity: tensor has well-defined min and max)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
